  "agent.compaction.memoryFlush": { type: "boolean", description: "ATO-676. Before a compaction, ask the model for short dated observations (\"YYYY-MM-DD: ...\") about the records being compacted and store them as one memory note tagged `observations`. A private side call: the visible chat is unchanged, and a failed flush never stops the compaction. Optional: absent means off (the default)." },
